# Repo conventions

```
frameworks/           # shared ELC constants (inherit these)
courses/<CODE>/       # one folder per course code (MCF3M, …)
  AGENTS.md           # course agent notes (inherits frameworks/)
  sources/            # PDFs, IMSCC, immutable inputs
  curriculum/         # expectations DB + markdown
  modules/            # lesson/module drafts
agents/               # cross-cutting agent prompts
scripts/              # tooling
```

- New courses copy the `courses/MCF3M/` shape and inherit `frameworks/` + root `AGENTS.md`.
- Put shared school rules only under `frameworks/` or `.cursor/rules/`, not duplicated per course.
- Teaching content > app scaffolding. Docstrings required on new functions/methods.
- Do not commit unless explicitly asked.
